{"id":"f719c6b47e823a62","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-df-zfc-rel-equivalence-closure-relation.md","title":"ZFC Rel Equivalence Closure Relation","display":"df-zfc-rel-equivalence-closure-relation — ZFC Rel Equivalence Closure Relation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-rel-equivalence-closure-relation","aliases":["58-df-zfc-rel-equivalence-closure-relation"],"display":"df-zfc-rel-equivalence-closure-relation — ZFC Rel Equivalence Closure Relation","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch02/58-df-equivalence-relation]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-rel-equivalence-closure-relation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-rel-equivalence-closure-relation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-rel-equivalence-closure-relation — ZFC Rel Equivalence Closure Relation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"908bc7b079f5d25b\" href=\"?note=908bc7b079f5d25b\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-equivalence-relation\">../batch02/58-df-equivalence-relation</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> (base set)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq X\\times X\">\\(R\\subseteq X\\times X\\)</span> (relation candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\\subseteq X\\times X\">\\(E\\subseteq X\\times X\\)</span> (closure candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EquivRel}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{EquivRel}_S\\)</span> (equivalence-relation predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"908bc7b079f5d25b\" href=\"?note=908bc7b079f5d25b\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-equivalence-relation\">../batch02/58-df-equivalence-relation</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRelEquivalenceClosureRelation}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRelEquivalenceClosureRelation}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}rel\\text{-}equivalence\\text{-}closure\\text{-}relation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcRelEquivalenceClosureRelation}_S(E,R,X)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\nR\\subseteq X\\times X\n\\land\n\\mathrm{EquivRel}_S(E,X)\n\\land\nR\\subseteq E\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\forall S\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{EquivRel}_S(S,X)\\land R\\subseteq S\n\\to E\\subseteq S\n\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}rel\\text{-}equivalence\\text{-}closure\\text{-}relation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcRelEquivalenceClosureRelation}_S(E,R,X)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\nR\\subseteq X\\times X\n\\land\n\\mathrm{EquivRel}_S(E,X)\n\\land\nR\\subseteq E\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\forall S\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{EquivRel}_S(S,X)\\land R\\subseteq S\n\\to E\\subseteq S\n\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The closure is characterized as the least equivalence relation containing <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span>, avoiding an untyped class intersection.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-equivalence-relation","status":"resolved","id":"908bc7b079f5d25b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-equivalence-relation]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-equivalence-relation","status":"resolved","id":"908bc7b079f5d25b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{EquivRel}_S$ (equivalence-relation predicate, see [[../batch02/58-df-equivalence-relation]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"R\\subseteq X\\times X","display":false},{"tex":"E\\subseteq X\\times X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EquivRel}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcRelEquivalenceClosureRelation}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}rel\\text{-}equivalence\\text{-}closure\\text{-}relation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcRelEquivalenceClosureRelation}_S(E,R,X)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\nR\\subseteq X\\times X\n\\land\n\\mathrm{EquivRel}_S(E,X)\n\\land\nR\\subseteq E\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\n\\forall S\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{EquivRel}_S(S,X)\\land R\\subseteq S\n\\to E\\subseteq S\n\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"R","display":false}],"bytes":1263,"backlinks":[{"id":"42343339d913bb42","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcRelEquivalenceClosureRelation}_S(E,R,D)$ (see [[../batch15/58-df-zfc-rel-equivalence-closure-relation.md]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3308","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-rel-equivalence-closure-relation.md|58-df-zfc-rel-equivalence-closure-relation]]（batch15）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","908bc7b079f5d25b"]}